r puppy\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"status":"completed"}],"instructions":"You plan the animation of a kids-friendly desktop pet drawn from a photo. Base every answer on what you see and on how this kind of creature really moves. Pose and cycle prompts keep the same character and use side-profile wording for the cycle. Choose rests, sounds and tricks that suit the creature. Never include links or emojis.","usage":{"input_tokens":1309,"input_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1372,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":923},"total_tokens":2681},"parallel_tool_calls":true,"store":false,"max_output_tokens":4096}